# Environment for the local Edge Functions. Copy to supabase/functions/.env
# (gitignored) and restart Supabase (npm run db:stop && npm run db:start).
#
# Nothing is needed locally. Leave APP_ENV unset (it means "local").
#
# ALLOW_FAKE_LOCATION is retired: picking a location on the map is now part of
# Dev mode (admins on a local or staging database, decided by the database).
# Remove it from your supabase/functions/.env.
